    <body dur="4:16.274">
        <div begin="19.828" end="4:16.274">
            <p begin="19.828" end="23.752" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1">I took my baby on a Saturday bang<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我带着我的宝贝去度周末</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="24.271" end="25.889" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1">Boy is that girl with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">“小伙子，这是你的姑娘？”</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="25.889" end="27.967" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1">Yes we&apos;re one and the same<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">&quot;是的，我们心心相印，合二为一&quot;</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="28.302" end="30.036" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1">Now I believe in miracles<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">现在我相信奇迹</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="30.036" end="33.319" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1">And a miracle has happened tonight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">而今夜奇迹已经显现</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="36.083" end="38.633" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1">But, if you&apos;re thinkin&apos; about my baby<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但如果你在意我的孩子</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="38.633" end="42.171" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1">It don&apos;t matter if you&apos;re black or white<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这没有关系无论你是黑是白</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="44.345" end="47.462" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1">I said If You&apos;re Thinkin&apos; About My Baby<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我说如果你在意我的孩子</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="47.462" end="51.107" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1">It Don&apos;t Matter If You&apos;re Black Or White<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这没有关系无论你是黑是白</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="53.358" end="56.220" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1">I said If You&apos;re Thinkin&apos; About My brother<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我说如果你在意我的孩子</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="56.220" end="1:01.400" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1">It Don&apos;t Matter If You&apos;re Black Or White<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这没有关系无论你是黑是白</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:26.458" end="1:29.824" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1">They print my message in the Saturday Sun<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他们把我的消息印在《太阳报》上</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:30.513" end="1:34.011" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1">I had to tell them I ain&apos;t second to none<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我不得不告诉他们我不是最好的</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:34.316" end="1:36.713" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1">And I told about equality and it&apos;s true<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我坚信人人平等这个真理</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:36.713" end="1:39.651" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1">Either you&apos;re wrong or you&apos;re right<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">无论你是错误或是正确都改变不了</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:41.074" end="1:44.579" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1">But, if you&apos;re thinkin&apos; about my baby<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但如果你在意我的孩子</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:44.579" end="1:47.699" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1">It don&apos;t matter if you&apos;re black or white<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这没有关系无论你是黑是白</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="2:03.409" end="2:05.324" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1">I am tired of this devil<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我厌倦了这样的谬误</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="2:05.324" end="2:07.282" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1">I am tired of this stuff<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我厌倦了这样的素材</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="2:07.282" end="2:09.369" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1">I am tired of this business<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我厌倦了这些勾当</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="2:09.369" end="2:11.495" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1">Sew when the going gets rough<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只到亡羊才去补牢</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="2:11.495" end="2:13.466" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1">I ain&apos;t scared of your brother<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我不怕你的哥们</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="2:13.466" end="2:15.498" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1">I ain&apos;ts scared of no sheets<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我不怕小报绯闻</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="2:15.498" end="2:17.634" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1">I ain&apos;t scared of nobody<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我不怕任何人</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="2:17.634" end="2:19.528" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1">Girl when the goin&apos; gets mean<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">宝贝只要一切有意义</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="2:22.098" end="2:24.499" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1">Protection For gangs, clubs, and nations<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">保护帮派、社团和民族</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="2:24.499" end="2:26.163" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1">Causing grief in human relations<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">人际关系不断遭到创伤</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="2:26.163" end="2:28.335" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1">It&apos;s a turf war on a global scale<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这是地盘战争遍及全世界</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="2:28.335" end="2:30.260" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1">I&apos;d rather hear both sides of the tale<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我宁可兼听双方的故事</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="2:30.260" end="2:31.552" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1">See, it&apos;s not about races<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">无关于种族</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="2:31.552" end="2:33.406" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1">Just places Faces<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只管于地域和脸面</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="2:33.406" end="2:34.210" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1">Where your blood comes from<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你血缘来自哪里</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="2:34.210" end="2:35.237" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1">Is were your space is<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">哪里就是你的空间</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="2:35.237" end="2:36.662" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1">I&apos;ve seen the bright get duller<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我看见光明正在黯淡</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="2:36.662" end="2:38.780" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1">I&apos;m not going to spend my life being a color<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我不会花一辈子时间为了某种肤色而活</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="2:42.784" end="2:44.515" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1">Don&apos;t tell me you agree with me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">不要跟我说你同意我的言论</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="2:44.515" end="2:47.618" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1">When I saw you kicking dirt in my eye<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">当我看见你在我面前恶意中伤我</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="2:49.859" end="2:52.627" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1">But, if you&apos;re thinkin&apos; about my baby<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但如果你在意我的孩子</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="2:52.627" end="2:56.094" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1">It don&apos;t matter if you&apos;re black or white<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这没有关系无论你是黑是白</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="2:58.353" end="3:01.518" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1">I said if you&apos;re thinkin&apos; of being my baby<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我说如果你在意我的孩子</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="3:01.518" end="3:04.244" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1">It don&apos;t matter if you&apos;re black or white<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这没有关系无论你是黑是白</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="3:06.575" end="3:09.362" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1">I said if you&apos;re thinkin&apos; of being my brother<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但如果你在意当我的兄弟</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="3:09.362" end="3:15.441" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1">It don&apos;t matter if you&apos;re black or white<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这没有关系无论你是黑是白</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="3:20.897" end="3:24.087" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1">NO Matter If You&apos;re Black Or White<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">无论你是黑是白</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="3:24.958" end="3:29.557" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1">NO Matter If You&apos;re Black Or White<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">无论你是黑是白</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="3:30.340" end="3:34.399" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1">It&apos;s Black, It&apos;s White It&apos;s Tough For You To Get By<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这是黑，这是白，这很难让他们找到</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="3:34.399" end="3:38.348" itunes:key="L47" ttm:agent="v1">It&apos;s Black , It&apos;s White It&apos;s Tough For You To Get By<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这是黑，这是白，这很难让他们找到</span>
